"pushes": {"265": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 380fedbb18002297f1b233bd9c09764e59ddaa86 with FENNEC_68_1b8_BUILD1 a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6e8e608ae2176f970242e8a752031608f8a9b54a", "parents": ["380fedbb18002297f1b233bd9c09764e59ddaa86"], "tags": []}], "date": 1566837945, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "266": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 380fedbb18002297f1b233bd9c09764e59ddaa86 with FIREFOX_68_1_0esr_BUILD1 a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d0b46f2831d7a4ac2e9b1a5f7eef11ba1a6d44a1", "parents": ["6e8e608ae2176f970242e8a752031608f8a9b54a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1566838286, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "267": {"changesets": [{"author": "Peter Van der Beken \u003cpeterv@propagandism.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1570330 - Make test_doorhanger_homepage_button (in browser_ext_chrome_settings_overrides_home.js) wait on page load before moving to next task. r=Gijs, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D43088", "files": ["browser/components/extensions/test/browser/browser_ext_chrome_settings_overrides_home.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "eb30f2268ed62cd74197760b440f3694000b3e23", "parents": ["d0b46f2831d7a4ac2e9b1a5f7eef11ba1a6d44a1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ehsan Akhgari \u003cehsan@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1543527 - Make browser_cookieBetweenTabs.js clean up after itself; r=baku, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D42189", "files": ["toolkit/components/antitracking/test/browser/browser_cookieBetweenTabs.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ac65e797aae61f0e0e57b1e280487682dee66726", "parents": ["eb30f2268ed62cd74197760b440f3694000b3e23"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrei Lazar \u003candrei.a.lazar@softvision.ro\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1575605 - Crash in [@ java.lang.NullPointerException: at org.mozilla.gecko.home.TabMenuStripLayout.onPageSelected(TabMenuStripLayout.java)]. r=VladBaicu, a=jcristau\n\nNow performing a sanity check after grabbing the child at position due to the fact that it can be\nnull if the position is out of array bounds (this usually happens when all panels are hidden and we request an orientation change).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D43236", "files": ["mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/home/TabMenuStripLayout.java"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "237a68d44b4b6b97b5db5e62bfd1c83b5c48cf06", "parents": ["ac65e797aae61f0e0e57b1e280487682dee66726"], "tags": []}], "date": 1566917164, "git_changesets": [null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "268": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 380fedbb18002297f1b233bd9c09764e59ddaa86 with FENNEC_68_1b8_RELEASE a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1d2fdbf84dec993a7d15f4d97a833ff2ebecdd25", "parents": ["237a68d44b4b6b97b5db5e62bfd1c83b5c48cf06"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Automatic version bump CLOSED TREE NO BUG a=release DONTBUILD", "files": ["mobile/android/config/version-files/beta/version_display.txt"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "73df84d76de5b3548943074b0812d5e511cb6955", "parents": ["1d2fdbf84dec993a7d15f4d97a833ff2ebecdd25"], "tags": []}], "date": 1566917447, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "269": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jorg K \u003cjorgk@jorgk.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Close the TB 68.0.x verbranch. a=jorgk DONTBUILD", "files": [], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9f911c5e938572d54dac26744952b950f8b0ea16", "parents": ["2f459603370d1d35a56ca4e9cee21f7766bbb832"], "tags": []}], "date": 1566976527, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "mozilla@jorgk.com"}, "270": {"changesets": [{"author": "Geoff Lankow \u003cgeoff@darktrojan.net\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1529205 - Remove DateTimePickerParent's dependency on gBrowser; r=mconley a=jorgk\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D35392", "files": ["browser/base/content/tabbrowser.js", "browser/modules/FormValidationHandler.jsm", "toolkit/content/widgets/browser-custom-element.js", "toolkit/modules/DateTimePickerParent.jsm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "924efe646715052154f12ae0e82e5018ffcc9fe7", "parents": ["380fedbb18002297f1b233bd9c09764e59ddaa86"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos Alvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1561288 - Don't override currentContent when focusing something on a shadow root. r=smaug a=jorgk\n\nIt is wrong, what we're trying to focus is frame-\u003eGetContent() still.\n\nThis is not reproducible outside of Thunderbird because for it to happen the\nfocus manager needs to wrap around the start content.\n\nHere's what's going on:\n\n * We start with a \u003ctree\u003e focused, which is a shadow host.\n * There's nothing else to focus inside the \u003ctree\u003e, or after the \u003ctree\u003e in document order.\n * So we restart the search with a different tabindex (1), but find nothing before the tree (since all focusable elements before the tree also have tabindex 0), and we return wrongly in [1], instead of searching with tabindex 0 again afterwards. (Since the child frame is not focusable, we wrongly end up at [1], and returning early, since currentContent != frame-\u003eGetContent(), instead of keeping looking for the right thing to focus.)\n\nAs I said this cannot reproduce on content, as far as I can tell, so I'm not\nsure how to go about testing this, but all the shadow dom tab navigation tests\nkeep passing with this change.\n\n[1]: https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/06bd14ced96f25ff1dbd5352cb985fc0fa12a64e/dom/base/nsFocusManager.cpp#3560\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D36196", "files": ["dom/base/nsFocusManager.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4112ceba2bd327873fefec99dc79134d28995f9f", "parents": ["924efe646715052154f12ae0e82e5018ffcc9fe7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tim Nguyen \u003cntim.bugs@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1563529 - Make HTML inputs inherit font in global.css. r=dao a=jorgk\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D36933", "files": ["toolkit/themes/shared/global.inc.css"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "fc32651d572e3f3acaaf4bdf03f467c33c44724c", "parents": ["4112ceba2bd327873fefec99dc79134d28995f9f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kai Engert \u003ckaie@kuix.de\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1559900 - Allow applications to add sections to about:license. r=mhoye a=jorgk", "files": ["toolkit/content/license.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2804109b79fa95c99ef8d81bde46d2dbd03a0a60", "parents": ["fc32651d572e3f3acaaf4bdf03f467c33c44724c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Geoff Lankow \u003cgeoff@darktrojan.net\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1561650 - Ignore unused modifier keys on keydown events in \u003ctree\u003e r=vporof a=jorgk\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D38248", "files": ["toolkit/content/widgets/tree.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d7e10472e61a8cd33c16098a346eaa4affafdc07", "parents": ["2804109b79fa95c99ef8d81bde46d2dbd03a0a60"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kai Engert \u003ckaie\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1561366 - Don't delete key3.db when upgrading to TB 68.x (backout bug 1475775). a=jorgk", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/nsNSSComponent.cpp", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_sdr_upgraded_with_password.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "db09dc605344aabdd69b148b31563b3d84a6afb7", "parents": ["d7e10472e61a8cd33c16098a346eaa4affafdc07"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Lemley \u003crob@thunderbird.net\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1559199 - Add 'comm' prefix to list of potential index prefixes. r=dustin a=jorgk\n\nFixes failing index jobs on Thunderbird builds.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D38107", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/morph.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "bcb12c4a304f5939103f235433112bb22e3f1055", "parents": ["db09dc605344aabdd69b148b31563b3d84a6afb7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jorg K \u003cjorgk@jorgk.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1570719 - Skip more elements in spellcheck for MailNews. r=masayuki a=jorgk", "files": ["extensions/spellcheck/src/mozInlineSpellChecker.cpp", "xpcom/ds/StaticAtoms.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "66dd0d3bd890d15c14f34183929261fa47cc360a", "parents": ["bcb12c4a304f5939103f235433112bb22e3f1055"], "tags": []}, {"author": "alta88 \u003calta88\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1569791 - Construct MozTreecolPicker menus with closemenu attribute if the column has it. r=vporof a=jorgk", "files": ["toolkit/content/widgets/tree.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d2abfe1c06f6ffba9cd6b1da70b1358fc575f8f4", "parents": ["66dd0d3bd890d15c14f34183929261fa47cc360a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Lemley \u003crob@thunderbird.net\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1572836 - Add comm-esr68 to list of release branches for signing scopes. rs+a=jorgk\n\nTo fix build signing issues when releasing from comm-esr68.", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/util/scriptworker.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "bc88b743dafde191d127f4150238a06c2595a227", "parents": ["d2abfe1c06f6ffba9cd6b1da70b1358fc575f8f4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jorg K \u003cjorgk@jorgk.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Backed out changeset 6d7610f4d26d (bug 1360603 for causing bug 1500895) to build Thunderbird 68.0. a=jorgk", "files": ["toolkit/content/contentAreaUtils.js", "toolkit/content/tests/browser/browser_saveImageURL.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "94d72e1f80e04d5eb95a214b073ea945ebcfe454", "parents": ["bc88b743dafde191d127f4150238a06c2595a227"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Toshihito Kikuchi \u003ctkikuchi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1570845 - Call CoAllowSetForegroundWindow before ShellExecute to launch an application in the foreground. r=aklotz a=jorgk DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D43536", "files": ["widget/windows/ShellHeaderOnlyUtils.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7797030cd4fa86394e71bb57b879df9464a7ddee", "parents": ["94d72e1f80e04d5eb95a214b073ea945ebcfe454"], "tags": []}], "date": 1566983786, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "mozilla@jorgk.com"}, "271": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jorg K \u003cjorgk@jorgk.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1529205 - Follow-up: Fix linting/prettier issue. rs=white-space-only a=me DONTBUILD", "files": ["toolkit/modules/DateTimePickerParent.jsm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a2b4204edd360face0b27e0b7d8b06827ff5f2bd", "parents": ["7797030cd4fa86394e71bb57b879df9464a7ddee"], "tags": []}], "date": 1566991760, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "mozilla@jorgk.com"}, "272": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr68 repo-update HSTS HPKP blocklist remote-settings - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D43966", "files": ["browser/app/blocklist.xml", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/plugins.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "669e5df537bf19fecadfe72929d2a8751edff3e7", "parents": ["73df84d76de5b3548943074b0812d5e511cb6955"], "tags": []}], "date": 1567085163, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "273": {"changesets": [{"author": "Thomas Wisniewski \u003ctwisniewski@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1564594 - Add an Enhanced Search webcompat site patch r=nalexander,denschub a=jcristau\n\nThis patch ultimately overrides the user-agent which Fennec users send to Google Search pages, choosing a phone- or tablet-specific UA as appropriate.\n\nIt involves adding four new metadata keys to the webcompat addon's metadata for user-agent overrides: blocks, permanentPref, experiment, telemetryKey:\n\n- \"blocks\" specifies URLs for which any requests should be aborted. This allows us to block the Google service worker for now, as it has caused \"content corrupted\" issues in the past with other enhanced search addons (see https://github.com/wisniewskit/google-search-fixer/issues/1).\n- \"permanentPref\" specifies an about:config preference, which dictates whether the injection is used. Users may set this to `false` to disable the injection outright, and permanently; `true` or `undefined` values allow the injection to function normally.\n- \"experiment\" specifies the name of the experiment this feature is optionally gated behind. Only a Fennec-specific implementation is provided in this patch. The implementation simply queries Switchboard to determine if the experiment is active.\n- \"telemetryKey\" specifies which telemetry key should be flipped to \"true\" when this injection runs. We will use this to note whether enhanced search has actually been enabled for this profile. Only a Fennec-specific implementation is given in this patch, which actually just sets a Fennec Shared Preference, which Fennec's core telemetry ping later reads in Java to know what the ping should contain.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D41074", "files": ["browser/extensions/webcompat/data/ua_overrides.js", "browser/extensions/webcompat/experiment-apis/experiments.js", "browser/extensions/webcompat/experiment-apis/experiments.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/experiment-apis/sharedPreferences.js", "browser/extensions/webcompat/experiment-apis/sharedPreferences.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/lib/ua_overrides.js", "browser/extensions/webcompat/manifest.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/moz.build", "mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/Experiments.java", "mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/GeckoApp.java", "mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/telemetry/pingbuilders/TelemetryCorePingBuilder.java", "mobile/android/extensions/webcompat/data/ua_overrides.js", "mobile/android/extensions/webcompat/experiment-apis/experiments.js", "mobile/android/extensions/webcompat/experiment-apis/experiments.json", "mobile/android/extensions/webcompat/experiment-apis/sharedPreferences.js", "mobile/android/extensions/webcompat/experiment-apis/sharedPreferences.json", "mobile/android/extensions/webcompat/lib/ua_overrides.js", "mobile/android/extensions/webcompat/manifest.json", "mobile/android/extensions/webcompat/moz.build"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "46d112299d475ffd9ef1c598f1ddb2ff3eec3360", "parents": ["669e5df537bf19fecadfe72929d2a8751edff3e7"], "tags": ["FENNEC_68_1_BUI