ency and simplicity it also removes\nthe Windows checks; the configure system won't allow\nMOZ_BITS_DOWNLOAD if not on Windows.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D43493", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "toolkit/components/bitsdownload/Bits.jsm", "toolkit/components/bitsdownload/components.conf", "toolkit/components/bitsdownload/moz.build", "toolkit/mozapps/update/tests/moz.build"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b32fbb17f74e22e3e53b3ce85393956688c76b42", "parents": ["521a40f7a7cb79547a993d14d79a34544d4b5f7e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Ritter \u003ctom@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1570597 - Pass the -delayload flag to lld correctly for MinGW builds r=firefox-build-system-reviewers,mshal a=jcristau\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D43455", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/frontend/emitter.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4fab973331ec32d80e6c290f331e763522565985", "parents": ["b32fbb17f74e22e3e53b3ce85393956688c76b42"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan Henning \u003cjh+bugzilla@buttercookie.de\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1548776 - URL-decode all file names in GeckoJarReader. r=snorp a=jcristau\n\nAssuming the URL string the JAR reader receives has been completely URL-encoded,\nwe need to decode not just the first nested jarUrl, as already happens through\ngetZipFile(), but all subsequent path components, too.\n\nAt least for jar:-URLs received from Gecko, the above assumption certainly seems\nto be true.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D44033", "files": ["mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/gecko/util/GeckoJarReader.java"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7da23977b6bad26d426f1656c8f1ab2ec2f07d47", "parents": ["4fab973331ec32d80e6c290f331e763522565985"], "tags": []}], "date": 1567433767, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null, 