 Ritter \u003ctom@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1577872 - Bump MinGW version for updater fix r=froydnj a=RyanVM\n\nThis picks up 0a1d495478d8ed1a94fc77b9dbb428b7e0372588 needed by\nTor for the updater.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D44535", "files": ["taskcluster/scripts/misc/build-clang-8-mingw.sh"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b94820890d75e5a32864ab3371cb3c7f87e31d14", "parents": ["41412acdeff8ed4299cb70e14a689140de21cf0c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "hb \u003cnoone@janbambas.cz\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1575217, r=michal,dragana a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D43761", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/TunnelUtils.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpTransaction.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "49a043c443b9bfaa6aa118ad9479dc84150894a6", "parents": ["b94820890d75e5a32864ab3371cb3c7f87e31d14"], "tags": []}], "date": 1567689860, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "301": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr68 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D44829", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2968d430c71f49eacaaa7c1fd55f42f3b1493cae", "parents": ["49a043c443b9bfaa6aa118ad9479dc84150894a6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1567690049, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "302": {"changesets": [{"author": "L10n Bumper Bot \u003crelease+l10nbumper@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\ndsb -\u003e 63eedd990308\nes-AR -\u003e 969f7f304883\ngn -\u003e 717d50db8958\nhsb -\u003e 984e85692521\nnb-NO -\u003e 92c847b14865\npt-BR -\u003e deffa43fe455\nth -\u003e db70a3da873e", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "38992096d52f00ce90e3aab43d83340c699a4e87", "parents": ["2968d430c71f49eacaaa7c1fd55f42f3b1493cae"], "tags": []}], "date": 1567706429, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "303": {"changesets": [{"author": "L10n Bumper Bot \u003crelease+l10nbumper@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\nen-CA -\u003e f79d57f58a36\nfr -\u003e 9c7fe07a9160\nhe -\u003e 605b4e4d9761\nit -\u003e a18fb11fcbe0\nvi -\u003e a9deacca752c", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "de69333d177e8172a26cb1cbd09628445b5c78a2", "parents": ["38992096d52f00ce90e3aab43d83340c699a4e87"], "tags": []}], "date": 1567710028, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "304": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nick Alexander \u003cnalexander@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1579131 - Enable Leanplum/MMA in Android aarch64 builds. r=chmanchester a=RyanVM\n\nThis is not the minimal patch for this issue.  The minimal patch is a\none-liner that adds `MOZ_ANDORID_MMA=1` to\nmobile/android/config/mozconfigs/android-aarch64/nightly.  However,\nthe underlying issue is that the mozconfigs have not stayed internally\nconsistent.  To reduce the likelihood of a repeat of this\ninconsistency, it would be best to extract the shared flags and reduce\nduplication and the risk for inconsistent updates.  There's two ways\nto do that: teach `moz.configure` to have the correct defaults or\nshare some small stanza across mozconfigs.  The former is non-trivial\nand not worth the risk at this time.  The latter is trivial but more\neffort than this is worth.  Here's something in the middle: making all\nthe mozconfigs have minimal differences with the mainline mozconfig\nfor `android-api-16`.  This at least allows easy auditing of the\nmozconfigs with `diff`.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D44865", "files": ["mobile/android/config/mozconfigs/android-aarch64/debug", "mobile/android/config/mozconfigs/android-aarch64/nightly", "mobile/android/config/mozconfigs/android-x86/debug", "mobile/android/config/mozconfigs/android-x86/nightly", "mobile/android/config/mozconfigs/android-x86_64/debug", "mobile/android/config/mozconfigs/android-x86_64/nightly"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6a82263ef349f046bc6e356428c3d28e5b8f9784", "parents": ["de69333d177e8172a26cb1cbd09628445b5c78a2"], "tags": []}], "date": 1567718129, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "nalexander@mozilla.com"}, "305": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dorel Luca \u003cdluca@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1565119 - Disabled mobile/android/components/extensions/test/mochitest/test_ext_tabs_insertCSS.html on android 4.3 r=gbrown\ta=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com//D44819", "files": ["mobile/android/components/extensions/test/mochitest/mochitest.ini"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7334de381c228b6468dc5f56ab05f8c5c449d5d3", "parents": ["6a82263ef349f046bc6e356428c3d28e5b8f9784"], "tags": []}], "date": 1567730365, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "apavel@mozilla.com"}, "306": {"changesets": [{"author": "L10n Bumper Bot \u003crelease+l10nbumper@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\nel -\u003e b6010058046d\nes-ES -\u003e a8b0a6e552e9\nhe -\u003e 1ed0e8aa0406\nnl -\u003e abf38ef7e615\nsv-SE -\u003e 37c76b10782d\ntr -\u003e 6625c734b355\nvi -\u003e d5f9ae7a6723", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "04602533f0e5751fb86489b2975237285726f25b", "parents": ["7334de381c228b6468dc5f56ab05f8c5