orkarounds for ppc64le in js/src/gc and js/xpconnect/src. r=tcampbell\n\nDepends on D46421\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D46422", "files": ["js/xpconnect/src/XPCWrappedNative.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "31276424f433a6324e33704fe58c0715080df8c4", "parents": ["4db8c12af31454ce50a7b83a128e7ac92f98c894"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Steven Michaud \u003csmichaud@pobox.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1201401 - Work around a crash in CVCGDisplayLink::getDisplayTimes. r=spohl, a=RyanVM", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxPlatformMac.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "db0628eadb868e6e8a3e1134a1fc39131b40a28c", "parents": ["31276424f433a6324e33704fe58c0715080df8c4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Byron Campen [:bwc] \u003cdocfaraday@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1577719: Init r_log in the c'tor, to simplify things. r=mjf, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D45463", "files": ["media/webrtc/signaling/src/peerconnection/MediaTransportHandler.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6a1a2f27a8fc059742ed5b9bf1ff33ae5caad3d6", "parents": ["db0628eadb868e6e8a3e1134a1fc39131b40a28c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Byron Campen [:bwc] \u003cdocfaraday@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1581950: Prevent nr_ice_component_insert_pair from leaking. r=mjf, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D46231", "files": ["media/mtransport/third_party/nICEr/src/ice/ice_component.c"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "41dc8707b6ad955ff7b3c0635de856fda566cdce", "parents": ["6a1a2f27a8fc059742ed5b9bf1ff33ae5caad3d6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kris Maglione \u003cmaglione.k@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1579222: Don't discard scripts before they've been encoded for the cache write. r=tcampbell, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.servic