ove white space when committing composition. r=masayuki, a=RyanVM\n\nThis is regression by bug 1530649.\n\nAfter landing bug 1530649, we try to scan end point of replacement text. But\nin this bug's situation, afterRun becomes same as current ws run by landing\nbug 1530649. To get white space type of next of replacement end, we have to\nscan around end point again.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D45947", "files": ["editor/libeditor/WSRunObject.cpp", "editor/libeditor/WSRunObject.h", "widget/tests/window_composition_text_querycontent.xul"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "bf8b0830cda8e2d0364350449289711c4f74d398", "parents": ["ab811c93d57526ef77c5ddd2b6e268e94f193d08"], "tags": ["FENNEC_68_2b4_BUILD1", "FENNEC_68_2b4_BUILD2", "FENNEC_68_2b4_RELEASE"]}], "date": 1569244862, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "390": {"changesets": [{"author": "L10n Bumper Bot \u003crelease+l10nbumper@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\nca -\u003e d0c495280ee3\ndsb -\u003e 161c8d7fc00d\nes-AR -\u003e 7b7874ffc4eb\ngn -\u003e cc0e96e60fcd\nnb-NO -\u003e 60375921d4c0\nnl -\u003e 284c61f9b152\nsl -\u003e dd0145e54a93\nsv-SE -\u003e aae8ed68465e\nuk -\u003e c2644aceaf4e", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "bbb09d4cb3bef28c5b1a34bfd481640ce6a3f12c", "parents": ["bf8b0830cda8e2d0364350449289711c4f74d398"], "tags": []}], "date": 1569247241, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "391": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging bf8b0830cda8e2d0364350449289711c4f74d398 with FENNEC_68_2b4_BUILD1 a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8850b6f4bc1c65e54fc561b2e59177d00e58e5bf", "parents": ["bbb0