est will use the default timings instead of the faster ones.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D46476", "files": ["devtools/client/aboutdebugging-new/test/browser/browser_aboutdebugging_sidebar_connection_state.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "bb220cdca30af24e72107bb328badabaf43f6335", "parents": ["fb46b0255b8b592cfa032e63ff462ac927e1788a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1579858 - Should release RefPtr before CollectData is clear; r=smaug a=RyanVM\n\nmAboutToBeNotifiedRejectedPromises will be clear in AfterProcessMicrotasks()\nand mPendingUnhandledRejections will be clear after NotifyUnhandledRejections\nrunnable is handled.\n\nHowever, worker could terminate in any time, we still need to clear those\nstructures manually before CollectData is clear.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D46095", "files": ["xpcom/base/CycleCollectedJSContext.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7713dc189bd70729bcaef4d7a4541c07167ef92f", "parents": ["bb220cdca30af24e72107bb328badabaf43f6335"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alexander Surkov \u003csurkov.alexander@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1565318 - avoid richlistbox-popup duping initialization r=MattN a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D41780", "files": ["toolkit/content/widgets/autocomplete-popup.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "bfd9a632439dd55827ed0b5983d5081b11011f5b", "parents": ["7713dc189bd70729bcaef4d7a4541c07167ef92f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "James Teh \u003cjteh@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1582323: When a file input has DOM focus, focus the browse button inside it for a11y. r=MarcoZ a=lizzard\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D46386", "files": ["accessible/html/HTMLFormControlAccessible.cpp", "accessible/html/