r\u00e9 Bargull \u003candre.bargull@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1583268: Update tzdata in ICU data files to 2019c. r=jwalden, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D46924", "files": ["config/external/icu/data/icudt64l.dat", "intl/tzdata/GIT-INFO", "intl/tzdata/VERSION", "intl/tzdata/source/be/metaZones.res", "intl/tzdata/source/be/windowsZones.res", "intl/tzdata/source/be/zoneinfo64.res", "intl/tzdata/source/ee/metaZones.res", "intl/tzdata/source/ee/windowsZones.res", "intl/tzdata/source/ee/zoneinfo64.res", "intl/tzdata/source/le/metaZones.res", "intl/tzdata/source/le/windowsZones.res", "intl/tzdata/source/le/zoneinfo64.res", "intl/tzdata/source/metaZones.txt", "intl/tzdata/source/windowsZones.txt", "intl/tzdata/source/zoneinfo64.txt", "js/src/builtin/intl/TimeZoneDataGenerated.h", "js/src/tests/non262/Intl/DateTimeFormat/timeZone_backward_links.js", "js/src/tests/non262/Intl/DateTimeFormat/timeZone_backzone.js", "js/src/tests/non262/Intl/DateTimeFormat/timeZone_backzone_links.js", "js/src/tests/non262/Intl/DateTimeFormat/timeZone_notbackward_links.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5d7755e9c8b628856d201e748328ff0bdf439481", "parents": ["e23bdede48815e80719dd7c906eed4a75a1f3609"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Petru Lingurar \u003cpetru.lingurar@softvision.ro\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1569312 - Recycle Bitmaps to to ease memory pressure. r=Vladbaicu, a=RyanVM\n\nThe recommended optimization - BitmapFactory.Options.inBitmap for API 11+ could\nnot be used as that is only available for\n\"decode methods that take the Options object\".\nUsed Bitmap.recycle() though in an effort to reduce memory pressure and allow\nthe app gc the Bitmap object and reclaim memory as soon as possible.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D48155", "files": ["mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/media/GeckoMediaControlAgent.java", "mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/toolbar/CanvasDelegate.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/geckoview/DynamicToolbarAnimator.java"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2cd4761fba04503691c85b2abc4c9c46976d035f", "parents": ["5d7755e9c8b628856d201e748328ff0bdf439481"], "tags": []}], "date": 1570455011, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "451": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003cryanvm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Backed out changeset e23bdede4881 (bug 1577107) for bustage.", "files": ["dom/indexedDB/IDBObjectStore.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "70802ae403a2c5c47bb44633742e96029de9cee0", "parents": ["2cd4761fba04503691c85b2abc4c9c46976d035f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1570456551, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "452": {"changesets": [{"author": "Yaron Tausky \u003cytausky@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1577107 - Avoid following the prototype chain r=dveditz a=lizzard\n\nWith this commit we no longer follow the value's prototype chain when\ncreating index updates in IndexedDB.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D48150", "files": ["dom/indexedDB/IDBObjectStore.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4bf60541a4852a1eb212c4c6522f747a776b1448", "parents": ["70802ae403a2c5c47bb44633742e96029de9cee0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1570463009, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "453": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mats Palmgren \u003cmats@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1583660 - Reinstate default background color / size for -moz-range-track on Android.  r=jwatt a=lizzard\n\nThis reverts the changes from bug 1481593 / bug 1317870 which broke\nthe default rendering on Android only (since it doesn't have\na native theme for \u003cinput type=range\u003e).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D47345", "